   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A team member reeling in a hose after an eThekwini Municipality sewage and jetting crew refilled their truck with water from a hydrant after clearing a blockage from a sewer line in Durban, South Africa on 15 March 2019.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
