   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Sonalika Dalabehera, six years old, a resident of Sutarajpur village, has from an early age been taught to adopt the hygienic routine of using a toilet rather than an unhealthy habit of using fields.&#xA;&#xA;</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
   <dc:rights>
