   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">On 6 October 2020, wastewater is treated by workers at the Domestic Wastewater Management Site of the City of Bekasi (TPST). Bekasi is a commuter city within the Jakarta metropolitan area with more than 600,000 households and a population of nearly 3 million.&#xA;&#xA;</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
