     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Young girls use sanitary latrines at the Hamadab Primary School in Kulloeid area in in Port Sudan. Sudan.&#xA;&#xA;UNICEF supports this school with technical and financial assistance for construction, water and sanitation facilities, furniture, education supplies, textbooks and teacherâ€™s training.&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;</rdf:li>
